 .../GitHub.Collaborators.API.swift            | 193 -----------------
 Sources/GitHub Types/GitHub.API.Router.swift  |  37 ++++
 Sources/GitHub Types/GitHub.API.swift         |  27 ---
 4 files changed, 235 insertions(+), 220 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Sources/GitHub Collaborators Types/GitHub.Collaborators.API.Router.swift
